# AI Video Studio Kit — copy to `.env` and fill in. Never commit your real `.env`.
# Every value below is a placeholder; nothing here ties to any account.

ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=   # Optional — cloud voiceover generation. Leave blank to use the kit without narration.
OPENAI_API_KEY=   # Optional — AI moment-picking for the auto-clipper. Falls back to heuristic selection if blank.
